# IronFlockOS: what Debian's profile for chronyd (/etc/apparmor.d/usr.sbin.chronyd,
# which includes this file) does not allow and the image's chrony reads
# (/etc/chrony/conf.d/10-ironflockos.conf): the PTP source that
# ironflockos-ptp writes (confdir) and the NTP servers of proxy.conf that
# ironflockos-proxy writes (sourcedir). Without these lines chronyd, confined
# by AppArmor, would run without both (ADR-0020).
@{run}/ironflockos/chrony/{,**} r,
@{run}/ironflockos/chrony-sources/{,**} r,
